-  <main class="detail-main treatment-page" id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="detail-hero"><div class="wrap detail-hero-inner"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/care/">Treatments</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Braces &amp; Invisalign</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Cosmetic &amp; orthodontic care</p><h1>Braces &amp; Invisalign</h1><p class="detail-lead">Ask about the differences between braces and clear aligners and how a consultation can help identify which options may fit your needs.</p><div class="detail-hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">Call the practice <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="wrap editorial-layout"><div class="editorial-body"><section class="editorial-intro" aria-labelledby="overview"><p class="eyebrow">Your care, explained</p><h2 id="overview">A smile that fits your life.</h2><p class="intro-large">Orthodontic treatment can address alignment and bite concerns. Clear aligners and traditional braces use different mechanics, and their suitability depends on the teeth and movements required.</p><p>A consultation assesses your goals and helps distinguish achievable changes from cases that may need a specialist approach.</p></section><section class="journey-section" aria-labelledby="journey"><p class="eyebrow">The experience</p><h2 id="journey">How we approach this care.</h2><ol class="journey-list"><li><span class="stage-index">01</span><div><h3>Define the goal</h3><p>Talk about crowding, gaps, bite, comfort or appearance rather than choosing an appliance first.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">02</span><div><h3>Evaluate the bite</h3><p>The clinician checks alignment, gum health, existing restorations and the complexity of movement.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">03</span><div><h3>Understand the commitment</h3><p>Discuss wear requirements, appointments, hygiene and long-term retention after treatment.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="editorial-faq" aria-labelledby="questions"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2 id="questions">Questions worth answering.</h2><div class="faq-stack"><details><summary>Are clear aligners right for everyone?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. Some tooth movements and bite problems are better managed with other orthodontic techniques.</p></details><details><summary>Will I need a retainer afterward?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Retention is commonly needed to help maintain a corrected alignment; follow the treating clinician’s plan.</p></details></div></section><nav class="editorial-related" aria-label="Related care"><div><p class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</p><h3>Appointments</h3></div><a class="text-link" href="/care/appointments/">View related care <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></nav></div><aside class="editorial-aside"><div class="editorial-contact"><p class="eyebrow">Here when you’re ready</p><h2>Care begins with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us what matters to you. Our team can help you plan your next visit.</p><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">(630) 381-4021 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="editorial-aside-note"><span class="aside-monogram" aria-hidden="true">R</span><p>Raina Dental Care<br>Naperville, Illinois</p></div></aside></div></main>
