-  <main class="detail-main treatment-page" id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="detail-hero"><div class="wrap detail-hero-inner"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/care/">Treatments</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Exams &amp; cleanings</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Prevention &amp; family</p><h1>Exams &amp; cleanings</h1><p class="detail-lead">A routine visit is an opportunity to check your oral health, discuss changes you’ve noticed and plan preventive care.</p><div class="detail-hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">Call the practice <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="wrap editorial-layout"><div class="editorial-body"><section class="editorial-intro" aria-labelledby="overview"><p class="eyebrow">Your care, explained</p><h2 id="overview">Preventive care, built around you.</h2><p class="intro-large">An exam is more than a checklist. It is time to understand how your teeth, gums and habits are changing, to notice concerns early and to plan care at a pace that makes sense.</p><p>A preventive visit may include a review of your health history, examination of teeth and gums, indicated imaging and a professional cleaning. The appropriate frequency and type of care depend on your clinical needs.</p></section><section class="journey-section" aria-labelledby="journey"><p class="eyebrow">The experience</p><h2 id="journey">How we approach this care.</h2><ol class="journey-list"><li><span class="stage-index">01</span><div><h3>We begin with your history</h3><p>Share changes in your oral health, daily habits, medications and concerns directly with the dental team.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">02</span><div><h3>We examine and explain</h3><p>The clinician reviews findings, shows you what is relevant and explains whether any further evaluation is needed.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">03</span><div><h3>We plan prevention together</h3><p>Leave knowing what to focus on at home and when to return.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="editorial-faq" aria-labelledby="questions"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2 id="questions">Questions worth answering.</h2><div class="faq-stack"><details><summary>Do I need X-rays at every visit?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Not necessarily. Imaging is recommended based on findings, risk, history and the need for diagnostic information.</p></details><details><summary>How often should I schedule a cleaning?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Your dentist or hygienist can recommend an interval based on gum health, risk factors and previous findings.</p></details></div></section><nav class="editorial-related" aria-label="Related care"><div><p class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</p><h3>Oral cancer screening</h3></div><a class="text-link" href="/care/oral-screening/">View related care <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></nav></div><aside class="editorial-aside"><div class="editorial-contact"><p class="eyebrow">Here when you’re ready</p><h2>Care begins with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us what matters to you. Our team can help you plan your next visit.</p><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">(630) 381-4021 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="editorial-aside-note"><span class="aside-monogram" aria-hidden="true">R</span><p>Raina Dental Care<br>Naperville, Illinois</p></div></aside></div></main>
