-  <main class="detail-main treatment-page" id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="detail-hero"><div class="wrap detail-hero-inner"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/care/">Treatments</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Dental implants</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Implants &amp; oral surgery</p><h1>Dental implants</h1><p class="detail-lead">Explore options for replacing missing teeth. A consultation can help you understand the planning process and whether additional procedures may be considered.</p><div class="detail-hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">Call the practice <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="wrap editorial-layout"><div class="editorial-body"><section class="editorial-intro" aria-labelledby="overview"><p class="eyebrow">Your care, explained</p><h2 id="overview">A considered replacement for missing teeth.</h2><p class="intro-large">Dental implants can provide a foundation for a crown, bridge or other restoration. They are not the right answer for every person or every site, which is why planning comes first.</p><p>An implant consultation considers oral health, bone availability, existing teeth, medical history, restorative goals and the time needed for healing. Additional procedures or referral may be appropriate.</p></section><section class="journey-section" aria-labelledby="journey"><p class="eyebrow">The experience</p><h2 id="journey">How we approach this care.</h2><ol class="journey-list"><li><span class="stage-index">01</span><div><h3>Assess the whole picture</h3><p>Examination and indicated imaging help the dentist evaluate the tooth gap, surrounding tissues and restorative options.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">02</span><div><h3>Design the treatment sequence</h3><p>Discuss placement, healing, any grafting or referral needs and how the final tooth will be restored.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">03</span><div><h3>Restore and maintain</h3><p>Long-term implant health depends on regular follow-up and effective daily cleaning.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="editorial-faq" aria-labelledby="questions"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2 id="questions">Questions worth answering.</h2><div class="faq-stack"><details><summary>How long does implant treatment take?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Timing varies with site conditions, healing, any extra procedures and the type of final restoration.</p></details><details><summary>What if I do not have enough bone?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Some patients may be candidates for augmentation or alternative treatment; this requires individual assessment.</p></details></div></section><nav class="editorial-related" aria-label="Related care"><div><p class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</p><h3>All-on-4 dental implants</h3></div><a class="text-link" href="/care/all-on-4/">View related care <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></nav></div><aside class="editorial-aside"><div class="editorial-contact"><p class="eyebrow">Here when you’re ready</p><h2>Care begins with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us what matters to you. Our team can help you plan your next visit.</p><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">(630) 381-4021 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="editorial-aside-note"><span class="aside-monogram" aria-hidden="true">R</span><p>Raina Dental Care<br>Naperville, Illinois</p></div></aside></div></main>
