ctions relevant to the procedure.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">03</span><div><h3>Follow clear aftercare</h3><p>Healing guidance, warning signs and contact instructions should be reviewed before you leave.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="editorial-faq" aria-labelledby="questions"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2 id="questions">Questions worth answering.</h2><div class="faq-stack"><details><summary>Does every oral surgery take place in the office?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. Procedure complexity, patient health and specialist needs may mean referral.</p></details><details><summary>When should I seek urgent help after surgery?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Call for persistent uncontrolled bleeding, rapidly increasing swelling, trouble breathing or other serious symptoms; call 911 for life-threatening emergencies.</p></details></div></section><nav class="editorial-related" aria-label="Related care"><div><p class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</p><h3>Extractions</h3></div><a class="text-link" href="/care/extractions/">View related care <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></nav></div><aside class="editorial-aside"><div class="editorial-contact"><p class="eyebrow">Here when you’re ready</p><h2>Care begins with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us what matters to you. Our team can help you plan your next visit.</p><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">(630) 381-4021 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="editorial-aside-note"><span class="aside-monogram" aria-hidden="true">R</span><p>Raina Dental Care<br>Naperville, Illinois</p></div></aside></div></main>
