-  <main class="detail-main treatment-page" id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="detail-hero"><div class="wrap detail-hero-inner"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/care/">Treatments</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Pain management</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Comfort &amp; additional care</p><h1>Pain management</h1><p class="detail-lead">The practice lists pain management among its additional services. Call the team to discuss what it evaluates and whether a dental visit is the right starting point.</p><div class="detail-hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">Call the practice <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="wrap editorial-layout"><div class="editorial-body"><section class="editorial-intro" aria-labelledby="overview"><p class="eyebrow">Your care, explained</p><h2 id="overview">The right first step depends on the source of pain.</h2><p class="intro-large">Pain around the teeth, jaw or face may have different causes. A dental evaluation can help determine whether the concern relates to a tooth, the gums, the bite or another condition requiring referral.</p><p>The historical service description does not establish a dedicated pain-management program. Call the practice to clarify the scope of evaluation available.</p></section><section class="journey-section" aria-labelledby="journey"><p class="eyebrow">The experience</p><h2 id="journey">How we approach this care.</h2><ol class="journey-list"><li><span class="stage-index">01</span><div><h3>Describe where the pain occurs</h3><p>Share symptoms privately with the office and ask whether urgent evaluation is needed.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">02</span><div><h3>Determine the next step</h3><p>The clinician may recommend a dental examination, imaging when indicated, or referral.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">03</span><div><h3>Review the care plan</h3><p>Treatment depends on a diagnosis rather than a single generic pain-management approach.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="editorial-faq" aria-labelledby="questions"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2 id="questions">Questions worth answering.</h2><div class="faq-stack"><details><summary>What if the pain is severe?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Call the office promptly; serious swelling or breathing concerns require immediate medical evaluation.</p></details><details><summary>Do you treat every type of facial pain?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No such claim is made. Ask the office about the evaluation it offers and referral pathways.</p></details></div></section><nav class="editorial-related" aria-label="Related care"><div><p class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</p><h3>Emergency dental care</h3></div><a class="text-link" href="/care/emergency/">View related care <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></nav></div><aside class="editorial-aside"><div class="editorial-contact"><p class="eyebrow">Here when you’re ready</p><h2>Care begins with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us what matters to you. Our team can help you plan your next visit.</p><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">(630) 381-4021 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="editorial-aside-note"><span class="aside-monogram" aria-hidden="true">R</span><p>Raina Dental Care<br>Naperville, Illinois</p></div></aside></div></main>
