-  <main class="detail-main treatment-page" id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="detail-hero"><div class="wrap detail-hero-inner"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/care/">Treatments</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Veneers</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Cosmetic &amp; orthodontic care</p><h1>Veneers</h1><p class="detail-lead">Ask how veneers may change the appearance of teeth and what the process involves. A consultation gives you space to discuss preparation, alternatives and care.</p><div class="detail-hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">Call the practice <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="wrap editorial-layout"><div class="editorial-body"><section class="editorial-intro" aria-labelledby="overview"><p class="eyebrow">Your care, explained</p><h2 id="overview">Subtle refinements, thoughtfully planned.</h2><p class="intro-large">Veneers are thin restorations placed on the visible surface of teeth to change appearance. They may address shape, small gaps or discoloration, but they are not the only cosmetic option.</p><p>Preparing a tooth for a veneer can involve irreversible enamel removal. Your dentist should explain the alternatives and future maintenance before you decide.</p></section><section class="journey-section" aria-labelledby="journey"><p class="eyebrow">The experience</p><h2 id="journey">How we approach this care.</h2><ol class="journey-list"><li><span class="stage-index">01</span><div><h3>Understand the priorities</h3><p>Bring examples of what you like and what you want to preserve about your existing smile.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">02</span><div><h3>Review options and preparation</h3><p>Consider whitening, orthodontics, bonding or veneers, along with the amount of tooth modification needed.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">03</span><div><h3>Plan long-term care</h3><p>Discuss bite habits, replacement expectations, cleaning and follow-up.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="editorial-faq" aria-labelledby="questions"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2 id="questions">Questions worth answering.</h2><div class="faq-stack"><details><summary>Are veneers reversible?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Many veneer preparations are not fully reversible because some enamel may be removed.</p></details><details><summary>How long will veneers last?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Lifespan varies; veneers can chip or need replacement. Maintenance and bite factors matter.</p></details></div></section><nav class="editorial-related" aria-label="Related care"><div><p class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</p><h3>Teeth whitening</h3></div><a class="text-link" href="/care/whitening/">View related care <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></nav></div><aside class="editorial-aside"><div class="editorial-contact"><p class="eyebrow">Here when you’re ready</p><h2>Care begins with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us what matters to you. Our team can help you plan your next visit.</p><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">(630) 381-4021 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="editorial-aside-note"><span class="aside-monogram" aria-hidden="true">R</span><p>Raina Dental Care<br>Naperville, Illinois</p></div></aside></div></main>
