-  <main class="detail-main treatment-page" id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="detail-hero"><div class="wrap detail-hero-inner"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/care/">Treatments</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Teeth whitening</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Cosmetic &amp; orthodontic care</p><h1>Teeth whitening</h1><p class="detail-lead">Talk through professional whitening options, what may affect the result and how to plan treatment if you have sensitivity or restorations.</p><div class="detail-hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">Call the practice <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="wrap editorial-layout"><div class="editorial-body"><section class="editorial-intro" aria-labelledby="overview"><p class="eyebrow">Your care, explained</p><h2 id="overview">Brighter, while protecting what matters.</h2><p class="intro-large">Professional whitening can change the shade of natural teeth, but results depend on the type of staining, enamel condition and the products used.</p><p>Dental restorations do not whiten in the same way as natural teeth. A dental examination can help identify sensitivity risks, existing restorations and the order of cosmetic treatments.</p></section><section class="journey-section" aria-labelledby="journey"><p class="eyebrow">The experience</p><h2 id="journey">How we approach this care.</h2><ol class="journey-list"><li><span class="stage-index">01</span><div><h3>Start with an exam</h3><p>Check the cause of discoloration and discuss whether a cleaning or other treatment comes first.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">02</span><div><h3>Choose a suitable method</h3><p>In-office and professionally supervised take-home whitening options have different schedules and sensitivity considerations.</p></div></li><li><span class="stage-index">03</span><div><h3>Set realistic expectations</h3><p>Discuss shade variation, maintenance and whether visible fillings or crowns may need separate attention.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="editorial-faq" aria-labelledby="questions"><p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p><h2 id="questions">Questions worth answering.</h2><div class="faq-stack"><details><summary>Does professional whitening cause sensitivity?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Temporary sensitivity and gum irritation can occur. Let the team know about previous reactions.</p></details><details><summary>Do crowns and veneers whiten too?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. Most existing restorations retain their original shade and may need separate cosmetic planning.</p></details></div></section><nav class="editorial-related" aria-label="Related care"><div><p class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</p><h3>Veneers</h3></div><a class="text-link" href="/care/veneers/">View related care <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></nav></div><aside class="editorial-aside"><div class="editorial-contact"><p class="eyebrow">Here when you’re ready</p><h2>Care begins with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us what matters to you. Our team can help you plan your next visit.</p><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Book an appointment <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">(630) 381-4021 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div><div class="editorial-aside-note"><span class="aside-monogram" aria-hidden="true">R</span><p>Raina Dental Care<br>Naperville, Illinois</p></div></aside></div></main>
